*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "BRHL1210.PPD"
*Product: "(HL-1210W series)"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*ModelName: "Brother HL-1210W series native"
*ShortNickName: "HL-1210W native"
*NickName: "Brother HL-1210W series - native (unofficial)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "20"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Brother;CMD:PJL,HBP;MDL:HL-1210W series;CLS:PRINTER;"
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/BrotherNative/Filter/rastertobrhl1210"
*APPrinterIconPath: "/Library/Printers/Brother/Icons/BRLaser1210W.icns"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/B5: "<</PageSize[499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "12 12 600 996"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "12 12 510 744"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "12 12 408 583"
*ImageableArea ISOB5/B5: "12 12 487 697"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension ISOB5/B5: "499 709"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *TonerSave/Toner Save Mode: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *TonerSave
*DefaultTonerSave: False
*TonerSave False/Off: "<</cupsInteger10 0>>setpagedevice"
*TonerSave True/On: "<</cupsInteger10 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *TonerSave

*OpenUI *Density/Toner Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: 0
*Density -3/-3 (lighter): "<</cupsInteger11 97>>setpagedevice"
*Density -2/-2: "<</cupsInteger11 98>>setpagedevice"
*Density -1/-1: "<</cupsInteger11 99>>setpagedevice"
*Density 0/Normal: "<</cupsInteger11 100>>setpagedevice"
*Density 1/+1: "<</cupsInteger11 101>>setpagedevice"
*Density 2/+2: "<</cupsInteger11 102>>setpagedevice"
*Density 3/+3 (darker): "<</cupsInteger11 103>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Density

